        "original_id": "40e4ce8d-3ee9-5aed-8bc0-2312331f0cb2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Rolls-Royce Holdings plc, Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc., Rolls-Royce\n- Products: AWJ-21\n- Concepts: underwater discharge water jet propulsion, propulsive efficiency, acoustic signature, maneuverability\n- Topics: naval propulsion technology, destroyer-class combatants\n\nFacts:\n- Rolls-Royce was established in 1904 and today designs, manufactures, and distributes power systems for aviation and other industries.\n- Rolls-Royce Holdings plc is a British multinational public limited company that was incorporated in February 2011 and owns Rolls-Royce.\n- AWJ-21 is an underwater discharge water jet propulsion concept from Rolls-Royce Naval Marine, Inc.\n- AWJ-21 was among the first technologies tested for Sea Jet.\n- AWJ-21 had goals of increasing propulsive efficiency, reducing acoustic signature, and improving maneuverability compared with previous destroyer-class combatants.",
